WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,615 --> 00:00:07,906
<font color="#ff0000">Alih bahasa</font>: <font color="#0080ff">Reinhart</font><font color="#00FFFF">X</font>

2
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:35,703
