Ya, benar. Benar sekali.

219
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:36,857
Agak...

220
00:13:36,858 --> 00:13:38,359
- Sedikit di pinggiran kota.
- Oh.

221
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:41,153
Um, apa kau masih di...

222
