Kecamatan Belleville.

224
00:13:44,533 --> 00:13:45,616
- Benar.
- Jadi...

225
00:13:45,617 --> 00:13:46,701
Kau masih di sana?

226
00:13:48,495 --> 00:13:50,204
Bagaimana denganmu? Apa kau...

